  abilities:
  - title: March of the marionettes
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    description: Alice gains movement speed based on how many puppets are on the
      field.
  - title: The Doll Maker of Bucuresti
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    description: Alice summons one battle doll per cast, starting with Shanghai (melee),
      then Hourai (ranged), repeating this order with each summon. All summoned dolls
      vanish if Alice is eliminated.
  - title: 
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    description: Alice is now able to summon two dolls at once.
  spellCards:
  - title: Doll Judgement
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    description: After a certain number of attacks, the dolls deal immaterial damage.
  - title: Puppet Master
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    description: Alice's attacks deal additional immaterial damage, increasing by
      the number of dolls on the field.
